    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "Dear Mum and Dad,",
        "x": 180,
        "y": 170,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 1000,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\nHibiscus and I will be on the way to see you by the time you get this letter. No point writing to try and turn us back, we won't get it anyway.",
        "x": 380,
        "y": 170,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\nI know you don't want to admit it yourselves, but I know why you had to move again in such a rush.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\nI know you say the fighting's long passed and your village is nice and remote and the villagers are all fairly tolerant of Sarkaz, but does that really describe anywhere in Victoria anymore?",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\nBesides, according to you, everything's been just hunky-dory ever since the war in Londinium broke out. That's why we have to come see for ourselves if you're doing as fine as you say you are. If anyone's giving you trouble.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "\\nPoint being, we can talk when we meet. Promise me you'll look after yourselves.",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st2",
        "multi": true,
        "text": "Lava",
        "x": 180,
        "y": 520,
        "alignment": "right",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 800,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "sticker",
        "id": "st2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lava, you found the chili powder yet? We're not gonna make it in time for dinner if we don't start marinating the meat soon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop rushing me. We only need to get it done before they're home. Why's so much of their stuff in boxes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "A harp? I didn't know they learned music.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's their friend's. The really good one, Mr. Baroque. I think they lost all contact with him after the war broke out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Eurgh, they've still got our workbooks from primary school! I think we should just toss these...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't do that! We're almost never home. Mum likes to flip through them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Flip through these? It's not like we never visit... here's a pile of photo albums\u2014oof! Heavy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are these... all from when they were working in Londinium? I don't recognize any of these people... I think by the clothes, it's all their coworkers. Every photo in here has been kept like brand new.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "And under that are all the letters. Honestly, you'd think after moving so many times they'd have thrown these away... nothing but clutter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This pretty much represents most of Mum and Dad's life, after all... we're not going to get it organized just like that. Could you ask anyone to sort out their entire life that easily?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not to mention they have to head out for work during the day...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not in here\u2014not in here... maybe the shelves? Urk...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hibiscus, look at this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "These are recruitment notices... typist, gardener, childcarer... crossed out, all of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They used to work as engineers...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is living in Victoria really worth putting up with this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you make them leave, where else can they go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lava, put those notices back. And don't bring it up in front of them. We should just... focus on doing what we can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Can't find the chili powder. I'll ask the neighbors if I can borrow some.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait\u2014oh, she's just going to storm off like that... I needed to warn her not to get into rows with the neighbors...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
