    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, I'm living in...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_243"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Neighbor B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_243"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1",
        "duration": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A curious child peeks out from behind her mother's back, peeking at the young Sarkaz girl at their door."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_243",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ilsa, back in your room.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Neighbor B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We only just moved in not long ago...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_243"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. You've been knocking on every door before mine. Got something the matter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Neighbor B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My sister's making dinner, and we can't find where the chili powder went. Could we borrow a bit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_243"
    },
    {
        "text": "...So that's all, is it? Wait there a sec if you please.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Neighbor B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "The door closes, only to then creak ajar. Out peeks an inquisitive little head that stares at Lava\u2014or more precisely, at the horns on her head."
    },
    {
        "text": "The girl gulps somewhat anxiously, dithers for a moment, then reaches out a hand to Lava."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lava is well inured to being looked at this way by now, and doesn't twitch. Bit by bit the girl's miniature hand reaches close, and touches on the corner of Lava's hem."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow\u2014it's real clothes. Not witchcrafty ones.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Curious Girl"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_ceramicrack"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_243"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ilsa! Get back here now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Neighbor B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The mother drops what she was holding, runs to the door, and shields her child behind her. The calm has fled her face. It was bound to."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_243"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have what you're looking for. You can move along.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Neighbor B"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
