    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "With a furtive rustle, Ilsa climbs out the loft window and excitedly sends the sign to her friends. Soon, more and more people in the street are coming to a standstill as they spot a strange scene unfolding in the distance\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "An unwelcome Sarkaz with a chilly expression walking through their village, and a gaggle of children tiptoeing not far behind her."
    },
    {
        "text": "The lot of them duck behind bushes, dodge behind trees, wink and signal to each other, and occasionally talk into imaginary walkie-talkies in their hands."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reporting in. The devil's at the haypile in front of Tom's place. She's about to reach his front door. Over!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ilsa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_240"
    },
    {
        "text": "Roger that! Defense artillery is in place!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_418_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mind, children, you oughtn't catapult things at her. You'll be putting yourselves in great danger...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Concerned Passerby"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "At an adult's intervention, the children squawk like fowlbeasts and scatter, only to gather again soon after."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch. Listen, you lot...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The devil's spotted us! Evacuate!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Children"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Devil...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What a pain. I need to just scare them off.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_firemagic",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_700_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, look, there's all shiny footprints down the street she went. What's that about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rose"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_240"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on, I'm gonna check it out\u2014whoa, whoa, giddy up, it's all fire! Wherever she walks, it's catching fire!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemme see\u2014it is! All these footprints are lit on fire! That's amazing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ilsa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_700_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, she's getting out of sight! After her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rose"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "(What, still not enough to scare you?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lava stares briefly at the catapults in their hands."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, fine. It'd be more hassle if I got any of you hurt. Try this on for size, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah-choo\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_firemagic",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_240"
    },
    {
        "text": "She just sneezed fire! Whoa, now she's got all fire wings!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_661_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_700_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wowww\u2014! So...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ilsa & Rose"
    },
    {
        "text": "So cool!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ilsa & Rose"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Okay, you kids have got taste.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
        "keep": true,
        "amount": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_rhodesinpatientcenter",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1456_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sobs uncontrollably)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Sick Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Briefly at a loss, Lava rummages in her bag for a sweet to try and pacify the child, but then Hibiscus floats to mind, telling her children need to be on an empty stomach when testing their blood."
    },
    {
        "text": "Screw her stupid sis! Dragging me out to help, saying these kids who just lost their parents in the war won't be that scared if they saw other Sarkaz. Well, they've been crying the whole time!"
    },
    {
        "text": "The relentless sobs throughout the ward leave her at a loss. For each and every day the war's still going, these cries will not come to an end."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... would you\u2014like to see some fireworks?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1456_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sobs)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Sick Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take that as a yes, then. Watch carefully, you only get to see them once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "May my fires bring light to the lands!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_firemagic",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$firemagic_explosion",
        "volume": 1,
        "delay": 1.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 40,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A firework formed of flame leaps to the ceiling, and bursts in the air over the ward. Lava steals a sideways glance at the children's faces. The fiery display enraptures them, and for just the briefest moment they forget to cry."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, the flame sets off the fire systems, and everyone is doused in sprinkler water. For a while in the ward, just a fleeting while, laughter takes the place of cries."
    },
    {
        "text": "Children are the same no matter where, it turns out. A flashy trick takes them in."
    },
    {
        "text": "...Is it really the same? No matter where?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "cameraeffect",
        "effect": "Grayscale",
